entries.worker_prompt:
HEARTBEAT_PATH={HEARTBEAT_PATH}
TASK_ID={TASK_ID}
RUN_DIR={RUN_DIR}
TARGET_REPO={TARGET_REPO}

Load the quality-playbook skill and run the playbook against TARGET_REPO. Use the absolute paths above verbatim; never derive paths from your cwd. Emit heartbeats per the SKILL.md 'Heartbeat emission' section: a ~3-min keepalive (qpb_heartbeat.py keepalive --run-state TARGET_REPO/quality/run_state.jsonl --heartbeat-path HEARTBEAT_PATH --task-id TASK_ID), an emit --status FAILED on any error before aborting, and a terminal line at run end. Return ONLY a one-line summary on completion (phase, last status) — do NOT echo heartbeat content.

